      "description": "The Kitakyushu Manga Museum celebrates the region's rich manga heritage, honoring artists like Leiji Matsumoto (Galaxy Express 999) and other creators born in Kitakyushu. Located in the ARUARU CITY entertainment complex, the museum features original artwork, interactive drawing stations, and a reading library of 50,000+ manga volumes.",
